{"in":{"id":22,"delta":[{"path":["items",0,"changes",0,"action"],"set":"改为多会话"},{"path":["items",0,"changes",0,"changed"],"set":true},{"path":["items",0,"changes",0,"effects"],"append":["当前绑定的会话将不再接收新消息。此后每个 thread 被 @ 时各开启一个新会话。","在单会话中进行过的 thread，如需继续须重新 @，这将开启一个新会话，不含之前的上下文。","以后切回单会话时，将继续使用原来的会话。"]},{"path":["items",0,"changes",1,"action"],"set":"确认更改"},{"path":["items",0,"changes",1,"changed"],"set":false},{"path":["items",0,"changes",1,"effects"],"set":[]},{"path":["items",0,"changes",2,"action"],"set":"确认更改"},{"path":["items",0,"changes",2,"effects"],"set":["无需 @：它可见的所有频道和私信中的每条消息都会发送给 agent，用量会明显增加。"]},{"path":["items",0,"connect","mode"],"set":"single-session"},{"path":["items",0,"connect","modeLabel"],"set":"所有 thread 共用一个会话"},{"path":["items",0,"connect","modeSentence"],"set":"它看到的所有 thread 都进入同一个会话，适合长期值守的助手仅在被 @ 时唤醒。"},{"path":["items",0,"connect","modeShort"],"set":"单会话"},{"path":["items",0,"connect","modeText"],"set":"单会话 · @ 唤醒"}]},"w":1793626086987.405}
